// Grounded Brain: GenAI Core Architecture (OpenAI · Mem0 · Vector Database)
// Eraser "Cloud Architecture" diagram-as-code. Paste into a new Cloud Architecture diagram at https://app.eraser.io
title Grounded Brain Notebook LLM: GenAI Core Architecture
direction right
colorMode bold
styleMode shadow
typeface clean

// ----- Client Layer -----
Client Layer [color: gray] {
  User Client [icon: monitor, label: "Web Client (AI SDK useChat / SSE Stream)"]
}

// ----- Application & Orchestration Layer -----
Application Orchestration [color: green] {
  Express API [icon: nodejs, label: "Express 5 API (TypeScript)"]
  Chat Service [icon: message-square, label: "ChatService (Prompt Assembly & Citations)"]
  Retrieval Service [icon: search, label: "RetrievalService (Query Rewriter & Top-K)"]
  Memory Service [icon: brain, label: "MemoryService (Personalization & Context)"]
  OpenAI Queue [icon: list, label: "Shared p-queue (4 Concurrent, 300 RPM)"]
}

// ----- Background Processing Layer -----
Background Jobs [icon: zap, color: purple] {
  Inngest Bus [icon: radio, label: "Inngest Event Bus"]
  Source Ingestion [icon: file-text, label: "process-source (LangChain Splitter)"]
  Conversation Memory [icon: refresh-cw, label: "summarize-conversation (Every 8 msgs)"]
  Artifact Synthesizer [icon: book-open, label: "generate-artifact (Zod Validation)"]
}

// ----- Core GenAI Layer: OpenAI -----
OpenAI Engine [icon: openai, color: orange] {
  Embedding Model [icon: layers, label: "text-embedding-3-small (1536d Vectors)"]
  Chat Generator [icon: cpu, label: "gpt-4o-mini / gpt-4o (Streaming RAG with Citations)"]
  Query Rewriter [icon: edit, label: "gpt-4o-mini (Contextual Standalone Query)"]
  Artifact Generator [icon: code, label: "gpt-4o-mini (Structured Outputs / Output.object)"]
  Rolling Summarizer [icon: file, label: "gpt-4o-mini (Condensed Chat History)"]
}

// ----- Core GenAI Layer: Vector Database Engine -----
Vector Database Engine [icon: database, color: blue] {
  Vector Index [icon: server, label: "Vector Index (HNSW Graphs · Cosine Distance)"]
  Payload Filtering [icon: filter, label: "Payload Filter (workspaceId Namespace Isolation)"]
  Top-K Semantic Search [icon: target, label: "Top-K Retrieval (Cosine Similarity)"]
  Storage Engines [icon: database, label: "Engine: Qdrant / Pinecone (Serverless / Self-hosted)"]
}

// ----- Core GenAI Layer: Mem0 Long-Term Memory -----
Mem0 Memory Layer [icon: brain, color: red] {
  Fact Extractor [icon: zap, label: "Fact Extraction Engine (Autonomous LLM Inference)"]
  Conflict Resolver [icon: check-circle, label: "Conflict Resolution (Preference Updates)"]
  Memory Recall [icon: search, label: "Semantic Search (Score >= 0.3, Top-5 User Facts)"]
  Memory Graph Store [icon: folder, label: "User Long-Term Profile (Cross-Workspace)"]
}

// ----- Data Persistence -----
Persistence [color: blue] {
  PostgreSQL [icon: postgres, label: "PostgreSQL 16 via Prisma (Chunks, Sources, Chats, Artifacts)"]
}

// ----- Data Flows & Interconnections -----
User Client > Express API: 1. Question / Upload / Artifact Request
Express API > Chat Service
Chat Service > Retrieval Service: Resolve Context
Retrieval Service > OpenAI Queue: Rewrite & Embed
OpenAI Queue > Query Rewriter: Standalone Search Query
OpenAI Queue > Embedding Model: Embed Search Query (1536d)
Retrieval Service > Top-K Semantic Search: Query Vector + workspaceId
Top-K Semantic Search > Vector Index
Vector Index > Retrieval Service: Top-K Grounded Chunks with Metadata
Chat Service > Memory Recall: Get User Facts
Memory Recall > Memory Graph Store: Query by user_id
Memory Graph Store > Chat Service: Personalized Memories
Chat Service > OpenAI Queue: System Prompt (<sources> + <memories>)
OpenAI Queue > Chat Generator: Stream Grounded Answer
Chat Generator > User Client: SSE Token Stream with Citations [1]

// Ingestion Pipeline Flow
Express API > Inngest Bus: source/created event
Inngest Bus > Source Ingestion
Source Ingestion > OpenAI Queue: Embed Chunks
OpenAI Queue > Embedding Model: 1536d Vectors
Source Ingestion > Vector Index: Upsert Vectors + Chunk Payload
Source Ingestion > PostgreSQL: Store Text Chunks & Tokens

// Memory Learning & Summarization Flow
Chat Service > Inngest Bus: conversation/summarize event
Inngest Bus > Conversation Memory
Conversation Memory > OpenAI Queue: Summarize Chat Turns
OpenAI Queue > Rolling Summarizer: Rolling Summary
Rolling Summarizer > PostgreSQL: Update conversation.summary
Conversation Memory > Fact Extractor: Extract Facts (infer: true)
Fact Extractor > Conflict Resolver: Deduplicate & Update
Conflict Resolver > Memory Graph Store: Save User Facts

// Artifact Generation Flow
Express API > Inngest Bus: artifact/generate event
Inngest Bus > Artifact Synthesizer
Artifact Synthesizer > PostgreSQL: Fetch Source Chunks
Artifact Synthesizer > OpenAI Queue: Structured Prompt + Zod
OpenAI Queue > Artifact Generator: Generate JSON Object
Artifact Generator > PostgreSQL: Save Validated Artifact
PostgreSQL > User Client: Render Flashcards / Quiz / Mind Map
